    <string name="settings_backup">Backup</string>
    <string name="settings_backup_howto">All data is stored only on this phone. A backup saves it to one file together with the settings.\n\nTo move your data to a new phone:\n1. Tap “Save backup” and save the file, for example to Google Drive.\n2. On the new phone, install Bolh and open Settings.\n3. Tap “Restore from backup” and pick that file.\n\nRestoring replaces the data on the phone with the data from the file.</string>
